<section id="home" class="hero top"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Chartered Engineer · Project Delivery · Industrial Automation</div><h1>Engineering Reliability.<br><em>Enabling Automation.</em><br>Delivering Value.</h1><p class="lead">I’m Isra Abbasi, a Chartered Engineer with 11+ years of experience in oil and gas, specializing in Instrumentation & Control, brownfield engineering, project delivery, and remote & autonomous operations.</p><div class="tags"><span class="tag">CEng (IET)</span><span class="tag">Ir. (BEM)</span><span class="tag">Ts. (MBOT)</span><span class="tag">PMP®</span><span class="tag">Functional Safety</span></div><div class="actions"><a class="btn primary" href="#expertise">Explore My Expertise</a><a class="btn secondary" href="#contact">Get in Touch</a></div></div></section>
<div class="wrap stats" aria-label="Career highlights"><div class="stat"><strong>11+</strong><span>Years in oil and gas engineering</span></div><div class="stat"><strong>2026</strong><span>OTC Asia Emerging Leader Award</span></div><div class="stat"><strong>2</strong><span>IEM Pinnacle Awards</span></div></div>
<section id="about" class="soft"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">About me</div><h2 class="section-title">Engineering expertise grounded in operational reality.</h2><p class="intro">My work spans the full engineering lifecycle—from concept development and front-end engineering to detailed design, procurement, execution, commissioning, and handover. I bring together technical assurance, practical problem-solving, multidisciplinary collaboration, and project delivery discipline to support safer, more reliable industrial operations.</p><p class="intro">My professional interests include brownfield automation, functional safety, instrumentation reliability, remote operations, and the responsible adoption of industrial digital technologies.</p></div></section>
<section id="expertise"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Technical portfolio</div><h2 class="section-title">What I do</h2><p class="intro">A selection of engineering disciplines and methods that define my professional practice.</p><div class="cards"><article class="card"><small>01 / CONTROL SYSTEMS</small><h3>Instrumentation & Control Engineering</h3><p>DCS, SIS, FGS, PLC, field instrumentation, control logic, system lifecycle upgrades, technical assurance, and commissioning.</p></article><article class="card"><small>02 / DELIVERY</small><h3>Project Engineering & Brownfield Modifications</h3><p>Scope development, FEL/FEED, design reviews, technical evaluation, contractor coordination, and execution readiness.</p></article><article class="card"><small>03 / TRANSFORMATION</small><h3>Remote & Autonomous Operations</h3><p>Engineering readiness assessments, remote operability, control integration, automation opportunities, and fit-for-purpose implementation planning.</p></article><article class="card"><small>04 / ASSURANCE</small><h3>Functional Safety & Asset Reliability</h3><p>Safety lifecycle principles, instrument diagnostics, root-cause analysis, risk-informed engineering, and condition-based maintenance approaches.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section id="journey" class="soft"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Career journey</div><h2 class="section-title">From engineering foundations to remote operations.</h2><div class="journey"><div class="milestone"><time>2009–2015</time><b>Engineering Education & Research</b><p>Electrical & Electronics Engineering and postgraduate study in Electronic Systems Engineering at Universiti Teknologi PETRONAS.</p></div><div class="milestone"><time>2015–2023</time><b>Oil & Gas Operations and I&C Engineering</b><p>Built hands-on expertise in instrumentation, control and safety systems, asset reliability, engineering troubleshooting, and brownfield modifications.</p></div><div class="milestone"><time>2024–PRESENT</time><b>Remote & Autonomous Operations</b><p>Focused on engineering delivery, automation readiness, remote operations, and cross-disciplinary technical coordination.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section id="recognition"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Recognition & leadership</div><h2 class="section-title">Professional excellence beyond the project.</h2><p class="intro">Alongside engineering delivery, I contribute to the profession through industry engagement, knowledge sharing, academic collaboration, and mentoring.</p><div class="recognition"><article class="award"><div class="year">2026 · INDUSTRY RECOGNITION</div><h3>OTC Asia Emerging Leader</h3><p>Recognition for professional contributions to the energy industry.</p></article><article class="award"><div class="year">2026 · ENGINEERING RECOGNITION</div><h3>IEM Pinnacle Awards</h3><p>Two awards recognizing engineering and professional achievement.</p></article><article class="award"><div class="year">PROFESSIONAL SERVICE</div><h3>ISA Malaysia & Academia</h3><p>Industry association leadership, academic engagement, technical speaking, and mentoring.</p></article></div></div></section>
